<title>USA: Mason Cty SDFC, Ky. won by Banc One Capital.</title>
<headline>Mason Cty SDFC, Ky. won by Banc One Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital said it won $2.64 million of Mason Cty Sch Dist Finance Corp., Ky., school building refunding and improvement revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
